// ===== #B45 TÌM ĐỀ NGHỊ GIẤY TỜ **TCG** — `Car_DocReqTCGList_Get_New20181119` (`FrmMngDocReqTCG`) =====
// Trace LIVE: `sv.SearchCarDocReqTCG` (`SalesService.cs:25072`) → WS `Car_DocReqTCGList_Get`
